sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Designer
    participant FE as Frontend Dataset Page
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DS as Local/Supabase Data Store

    U->>FE: Add or edit dataset row
    FE->>API: PUT /update (row payload)
    API->>API: Validate row and id
    alt row exists
      API->>DS: Update row in local JSON and Supabase
      DS-->>API: Update confirmation
      API-->>FE: 200 Row updated successfully
    else new row
      API->>DS: Insert new row
      DS-->>API: Insert confirmation
      API-->>FE: 200 Row created successfully
    end
    FE-->>U: Refresh table with latest data

